  "text": "Now when I want to watch with friends, nobody has to share their screen. Everyone's streaming on their own Mac, so it looks as good for them as it does for me. When we're all ready, there's a little countdown. 3-2-1. And it starts for everyone at the exact same moment, even if one of us is on the other side of the world. People can send reactions, and they float right across the picture. It honestly feels like being in the same room.",
